  <Properties>
    <articleTitle>
      <Value Culture="en"><![CDATA[First contact with the fifth-generation BMW X5: even the Chinese don't have such a range of engines]]></Value>
      <Value Culture="pl-PL"><![CDATA[Pierwszy kontakt z BMW X5 piątej generacji: takiej gamy napędowej nie mają nawet Chińczycy]]></Value>
    </articleTitle>
    <author>
      <Value><![CDATA[umb://document/833364f91e1e4f9a866584920b87dfba]]></Value>
    </author>
    <components>
      <Value Culture="en"><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "bc8cfc9b-08fe-4be1-8a61-49c6dedf32ba",
      "key": "21ebf361-8d51-4849-9b3b-e9e27151c426",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "componentText",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EThe all-new BMW X5 is being presented to the world as a revolutionary car on many fronts, but perhaps no other fact demonstrates the brand\u0027s technological leadership and courage in making visionary decisions than its engine lineup. The new generation of this popular SUV will (ultimately) be available with petrol, diesel, hybrid, electric, and hydrogen powertrains.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe BMW X5 is in many ways a pioneer of the automotive industry. The first generation of the E53 model series, introduced in 1999, was the first SUV built on a monocoque frame and shaped what is now the most popular car type in the world as we know it. In 2007, the first SUV coupe, the X6, emerged from it, paving the way for cars combining all body styles with a gently sloping roof and correspondingly rising price tags.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESuccessive generations of this best-selling model have focused on developing and optimizing these pioneering principles. Until now, BMW is presenting the fifth chapter in this story. The new X5 is one of the most important new additions in the generational transformation of the entire BMW model range, which by the end of next year will bring as many as 40 new cars built according to the Neue Klasse principles.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe first became familiar with it in the new iX3, unveiled almost a year ago, and were so impressed that we awarded it the Wirtualna Polska Car of the Year 2026 title. The bad news for the competition is that the new X5 raises the bar even higher, on many fronts: design, technology, drivetrain, and material quality. I had the opportunity to experience this firsthand during the model\u0027s secret preview in Munich, organized for a select group of media from around the world.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "ede3fd7a-2f08-469d-95c2-10791dfc795f",
      "key": "ab1ca4b8-2262-4f29-b9ff-3df4b5eef979",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EIt looks interesting and will definitely attract attention on the road \u2013 personally, it reminds me of the eccentric Bugatti Bolide hypercar... or characters from the DC comics. The Germans themselves went all out here: they know this isn\u0027t for everyone, so they can easily disable it via iDrive.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOn the other hand, in the fastest versions bearing the letter M, the position lights will be distinguished by their yellow tint. Initially reserved for the limited-edition CS models, this detail has become too popular to be left to them alone.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "imagePosition",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": [
            "Lewo"
          ]
        },
        {
          "alias": "image",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": [
            {
              "key": "8ddda6cc-f73b-4162-a084-1a869bea1b77",
              "mediaKey": "29773ff3-8095-4add-976f-7bd0fae2c37d",
              "mediaTypeAlias": "Image",
              "crops": [],
              "focalPoint": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
